* KSB596 PNP Power Transistor LTspice model
* Based on ON Semiconductor datasheet

.MODEL KSB596 PNP (
+ IS=1E-11      ; saturation current
+ BF=100        ; forward beta (hFE ~ 40–240, typical ~100)
+ NF=1          ; ideality factor
+ VAF=50        ; Early voltage (estimate)
+ IKF=5         ; corner for beta roll-off
+ ISE=1E-11     ; B-E leakage saturation current
+ NE=1.5
+ BR=10         ; reverse beta
+ NR=1
+ VAR=25
+ IKR=0.5
+ ISC=1E-11
+ NC=2
+ RB=0.1        ; base resistance
+ RE=0.05       ; emitter resistance
+ RC=0.05       ; collector resistance
+ CJE=200p      ; B-E capacitance
+ VJE=0.75      ; B-E junction potential
+ MJE=0.33
+ CJC=130p      ; B-C capacitance (datasheet)
+ VJC=0.75
+ MJC=0.33
+ TF=0.5u       ; forward transit time (from fT ≈ 3 MHz)
+ TR=50n        ; reverse transit time
)
